1Co 6:1 , The Corinthians must not vex their brethren, in going to law with them;
1Co 6:6 , especially under infidels;
1Co 6:9 , The unrighteous shall not inherit the kingdom of God;
1Co 6:15 , Our bodies are the members of Christ, and temples of the Holy Ghost. they must not therefore be defiled.
